Split function: used to split a string into array of strings

"Ravi,Hyderabad,55"   to ["Ravi", "Hyderabad", "55"]


Example:

data = [
    ("Ravi,Hyderabad,55",),
    ("Prabhas,Hyderabad,45",)
]

schema = StructType([
    StructField("details", StringType(), True)
])

df = spark.createDataFrame(data, schema)

df2 = df.select(
    split("details", ",").alias("details_array")
)
